      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The TMS decides when an order is Billable, and the ERP does everything after that. P9 and E1. It is the same whether a Carrier or the Own fleet carried\nthe goods.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The TMS decides when an order is Billable, and the ERP does everything after that. P9 and E1. It is the same whether a Carrier or the Own fleet carried\nthe goods.",
